    multinomial-equivalence-1027be5, S5 69b28a3e public bart2
    train-side matrix offset + messages + docs). The multinomial
    family is now a full conditional inside a larger Gibbs/MH
    sampler. Doors recorded there: k3countsswap scenario at the
    next multinomial re-record; no test-side bartcoreForestFits
    analog; ConfigSpec OP_SET_COUNTS rides the general multi-forest
    fuzz-arm gap.
